{
  "$comment": "EXP-1324: THE Trace, shadcn's Trace (radix-nova) as ONE look x4. Web = the @exp/ui primitive (`Trace`, `TraceLine`, `TraceIcon`, `TraceTitle`, `TraceDescription`, `TraceCollapsible`, `TraceCollapsibleTrigger`, `TraceCollapsibleContent`); desktop gpui, iOS ExpUI and Android Compose rebuild it pixel-exact from `geometry` (px = pt = dp). A LINE = [icon][gap][title][gap][description] in ONE row of `lineHeight`: icon box `icon` square (glyph fills it, muted-foreground), title truncates with an ellipsis (muted-foreground; hover/pressed foreground when the line is interactive), description shrink-free muted-foreground at `descriptionAlpha` with tabular figures. status `running` paints the TITLE with the design-tokens `motion.shimmer` (never the icon; reduce motion = plain text); `error` paints icon + title + description in destructive (rose); `pending` paints the whole line at `pendingOpacity`. A COLLAPSIBLE line appends, `chevronGap` after the line, the `trace-chevron` glyph in an `icon` box, rotated 90deg (pointing down) while open, rotating over motion `standard`; the whole row is the toggle. Its CONTENT sits `contentTop` below the row and `contentBottom` above whatever follows, as a column whose left rail is a `railWidth` hairline (the border colour) at x = `railInset` (= icon/2 - 1, centred under the icon), the children inset `contentInset` from the row's left edge and `contentTrailing` from its right; text inside defaults to the line font in muted-foreground. Lines stacked in ONE `Trace` sit `lineGap` apart. Sizes: `default` (the styleguide/eUI default, text-sm) and `sm` (the session transcript + issue activity: the transcript tool scale). Tool OUTPUT inside a tool line's content = the CodeBlock primitive at size sm with the `Output` title and the copy action (`execute` output: language `ansi`, the Terminal pattern; a failed call: the destructive variant); a subagent line's duration paints as the outline Badge after the title instead of muted text. `cases` lock the pure models in src/trace.ts (`traceTool`, `traceReasoning`, `traceSubagent`, `parseTestResults` + `traceFailedTests`); mirrors compare the WHOLE expected object.",
  "geometry": {
    "default": {
      "fontSize": 14,
      "lineHeight": 20,
      "icon": 16,
      "gap": 8,
      "lineGap": 8,
      "chevronGap": 4,
      "contentTop": 8,
      "contentBottom": 4,
      "railInset": 7,
      "railWidth": 1,
      "contentInset": 24,
      "contentTrailing": 4
    },
    "sm": {
      "fontSize": 12,
      "lineHeight": 18,
      "icon": 14,
      "gap": 6,
      "lineGap": 6,
      "chevronGap": 4,
      "contentTop": 6,
      "contentBottom": 4,
      "railInset": 6,
      "railWidth": 1,
      "contentInset": 20,
      "contentTrailing": 4
    },
    "descriptionAlpha": 0.7,
    "pendingOpacity": 0.6,
    "codeBlock": {
      "$comment": "THE CodeBlock primitive (shadcn code-block, radix-nova) at size sm: tool output inside a Trace line's content. Box: radius token `lg`, `border` hairline in the input colour over the input colour at `fillAlpha` (dark), clipped. Header row (the `Output` title: sans, `titleSize`, medium, foreground; trailing the ghost icon-xs copy button, `copyButton` round with a `copyIcon` glyph, ui-copy → ui-check for 2s): `padding` left/right, `padding` top, `headerActionsOutset` pulled into the right/top padding. Code: mono `fontSize`/`lineHeight`, `padding` on every side except `contentTopWithHeader` under a header, scrolls sideways (never wraps), at most `maxLines` lines tall before it scrolls. destructive variant: hairline = destructive at `destructiveBorderAlpha`, title + code text destructive, no fill.",
      "radius": "lg",
      "border": 1,
      "fillAlpha": 0.3,
      "padding": 10,
      "contentTopWithHeader": 6,
      "titleSize": 12,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "lineHeight": 19.5,
      "copyButton": 24,
      "copyIcon": 12,
      "headerActionsOutset": 4,
      "maxLines": 16,
      "destructiveBorderAlpha": 0.4
    }
  },
